      "factual_description": "BEATINK presents Adrian Sherwood presents DUB SESSIONS 2026 at Spotify O-EAST in Tokyo on Wednesday, September 9, 2026, with Adrian Sherwood vs Nightmares On Wax, support from SILENT POETS (DUB ENSEMBLE), and live painting by Peter Harris. The official promoter page lists open/start at 18:00 and general-sale tickets at ¥8,000 before the separate drink charge. BEATINK frames the collaboration around the 20th anniversary of Nightmares On Wax's 2006 album In a Space Outta Sound and Adrian Sherwood's 2026 dub reconstruction In a Space Outta Dub. The same bill continues to Yogibo META VALLEY in Osaka on September 10. Eplus independently confirms the September 9 Spotify O-EAST performance, the billed acts, 18:00 start, and active general sale.",
